7
00:00:17.347 --> 00:00:20.484
It's crucial to know the principles
of good database design.

8
00:00:20.484 --> 00:00:22.960
Because a poorly designed
database makes it hard,

9
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.340
if not impossible to produce
accurate information.

10
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:31.310
Having completed this module, you should
now be able to define the term database

11
00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:36.063
schema, describe the schema of different
database systems, create a basic

12
00:00:36.063 --> 00:00:40.761
